---
import TitleLv2 from "../common/TitleLv2.astro";
---

<section class="works-target">
  <div class="l-container">
    <div class="l-section">
      <TitleLv2 title="こんな方に向いています"/>
      <div class="l-section-body">
        <ul class="works-target-list c-list-green-line">
          <li class="works-target-item c-list-green-line-item">新しい企業・団体の信頼感をしっかり伝えたい方</li>
          <li class="works-target-item c-list-green-line-item">情報が多くなりやすい事業内容を整理して見せたい方</li>
          <li class="works-target-item c-list-green-line-item">更新運用を見据えたサイトを作りたい方</li>
          <li class="works-target-item c-list-green-line-item">サイトの表示速度を軽快にしたい方</li>
        </ul>
      </div><!-- /.l-section-body -->
    </div><!-- /.l-section -->
  </div><!-- /.l-container -->
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use '../../styles/breakpoints' as *;

